      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA SCANDAL (7) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (22.96) at this track in a Maiden over 400m. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Makes plenty of appeal. CHRONIC DON (2) jumped from a low draw and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.3 lengths (22.95) behind Roman Fly at this track. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Bold showing expected. UNDER A SPELL (1) missed the frame last time when fourth (18.42) at Richmond Straight but prior to that had two placings in a row. Better than last start and can bounce back. MYLA CARGO (6) can play a role in the finish without surprising.",
